<div class="projectsouterBox">
<h3>Redevelopment</h3>
<div class="home-projectBox">
<div class="home-projectImg animated anim_left"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4ODAiIGhlaWdodD0iOTAwIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/redevelopment.webp" alt="" title="" loading="lazy" width="880" height="900" /><noscript><img src="/images/redevelopment.webp" alt="" title="" loading="lazy" width="880" height="900" /></noscript> </div>
<div class="home-projectInfo animated anim_right">
<h3>Redevelopment</h3>
<p>As the old addresses and landmarks of Pune seek a breath of fresh air, redevelopment has become the most desired upgrade for Pune’s connoisseurs of lifestyle.</p>
<p>Ravetkar Group has developed an expertise in understanding this need for evolution, people’s expectations from it and delivering an evolved space that celebrates the new lifestyle, while nurturing the traditional charm of Pune.</p>
<div class="knowmoreBtn"><a href="/redevelopment.html">Know More <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" title=""><noscript><img src="/images/arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" title=""></noscript></a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="projectsouterBox">
<h3>Upcoming Projects</h3>
<div class="home-projectBox">
<div class="home-projectImg animated anim_left"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4NzkiIGhlaWdodD0iOTAxIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/upcoming.webp" alt="" title="" loading="lazy" width="879" height="901" /><noscript><img src="/images/upcoming.webp" alt="" title="" loading="lazy" width="879" height="901" /></noscript> </div>
<div class="home-projectInfo animated anim_right">
<h3>Upcoming Projects</h3>
<p>We are excited to announce a series of upcoming projects that promise to transform the real estate landscape. Our future developments aim to offer cutting-edge designs, modern amenities, and strategic locations, catering to a wide range of needs from residential to commercial spaces. With a focus on innovation and sustainability, these projects will be a testament to our dedication to creating spaces that enhance quality of life.</p>
<div class="knowmoreBtn"><a href="/projects/upcoming-projects.html">Know More <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/arrow.svg" alt="" title="" loading="lazy"><noscript><img src="/images/arrow.svg" alt="" title="" loading="lazy"></noscript></a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="projectsouterBox">
<h3>Completed Projects</h3>
<div class="home-projectBox marginbottom0">
<div class="home-projectImg animated anim_left"> <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4ODAiIGhlaWdodD0iOTAwIj48L3N2Zz4=" data-src="/images/completed .webp" alt="" title="" loading="lazy" width="880" height="900" /><noscript><img src="/images/completed .webp" alt="" title="" loading="lazy" width="880" height="900" /></noscript> </div>
<div class="home-projectInfo animated anim_right">
<h3>Completed Projects</h3>
<p>With a legacy of excellence, our completed projects stand as a testament to our expertise in real estate development. From residential complexes to commercial landmarks, each completed project reflects our passion for quality, design, and customer satisfaction. We take immense pride in our successful track record, having transformed communities and spaces with each endeavor. Explore our completed projects to see the enduring impact we've made in the real estate sector.</p>
<div class="knowmoreBtn"><a href="/projects/completed-projects.html">Know More <img class="jch-lazyload" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/images/arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" title=""><noscript><img src="/images/arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" title=""></noscript></a></div>
